# Session 10: 1805, one player, the Allies, Tactical off. Random events and the varied
# start (docs\won-source-study.md, section 3.2), in two games:
# - the first sets random events to Neutral and plays three turns;
# - Files, New Game then starts 1805 again with Vary Start.
seed 1
pace 1

wait 4
key space
wait 4
key s
wait 2
key down
wait 1
key enter
wait 3
shot objective
key space
wait 1

# Utility: Tactical off, then random events Neutral. That menu waits for a key after it.
key u t
wait 1
key r
wait 1
shot random-events
key n
wait 2
shot neutral
key space
wait 3
key esc
wait 1
shot main-menu

# The Allies only end their turns. Each turn: end it, wait for the French moves, then
# spaces to close the messages. At the main menu, and at the menus below that wait for a
# choice, a space matches no item and is dropped.

# The first turn: Bernadotte beats Alexander in Innsbruck, and the player chooses where
# Alexander retreats.
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot retreat
key v
wait 3
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot next-turn

key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot next-turn

# The third turn: the French beat three Allied armies in Vienna in turn, and each
# retreats to Austerlitz.
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot retreat2
key a
wait 3
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot retreat3
key a
wait 3
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot retreat4
key a
wait 3
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot next-turn

# The second game: Files, New Game (which also saves NWS.CFG), 1805 again, and Vary
# Start, which reloads the scenario with random changes.
key f
wait 1
shot files
key n
wait 5
shot start-menu
key s
wait 2
key down
wait 1
key enter
wait 3
shot objective2
key space
wait 1
key i down down down enter
wait 1
shot force-summary
key space
wait 1
key u v
wait 3
shot varied
key esc
wait 1
key i down down down enter
wait 1
shot varied-forces
key space
wait 1
key i enter
wait 1
shot varied-armies
key space
wait 1
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot next-turn

# The second turn: Alexander is beaten in Innsbruck again and retreats to Vienna. The
# session ends there.
key e y
wait 30
shot turn-end
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot retreat5
key v
wait 3
repeat 16
key space
wait 2
end
shot next-turn
